cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this fixed-case technical record, please cite the archived release."
type: software
title: "A Local Stereochemistry Audit of Two Public TankBind Test Cases"
authors:
  - family-names: Miyazaki
    given-names: Sho
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Tokyo, Japan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-1577-1217"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Fixed-case computational record of local tetrahedral orientation for five preselected
  carbon centers in two public PoseBusters TankBind test fixtures, using a common
  crystal-derived graph and predetermined atom mappings. All five local orientations
  were preserved within the specified coordinate-text rounding envelope. Includes
  fixed-case analysis, results, reconstructed transformation controls, and provenance;
  no general TankBind performance claim or PoseBusters error claim is made.
keywords:
  - TankBind
  - PoseBusters
  - local stereochemistry
  - atom mapping
  - reproducibility
